<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General des Eaux started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General des Eaux started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Pierre Stienon Wednesday started coverage of France's Cie Generale des Eaux with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The company should &quot;continue to benefit from extensive restructuring&quot; and a new and strong management team, he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Stienon set a 12-month price target of 860 francs, 14 percent above the current share price.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
